{"_id":"6a36b111c775c9d2ea014ef7","title":"Make your units intelligent with custom paths","game":{"_id":"6893d4f9c23f749e7052f89b","gameId":12912934221,"name":"WarCommand","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2f32ec9c6cf938f7e0e9867cab1139592d792fdf78decffd1f7a5849f24b5847.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-35fd69f9dd0370fe9c24ce568d206a47/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"12912934221-warcommand","path":"/game/12912934221-warcommand","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2f32ec9c6cf938f7e0e9867cab1139592d792fdf78decffd1f7a5849f24b5847.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-35fd69f9dd0370fe9c24ce568d206a47/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":12912934221},"slug":"WarCommand-Make-your-units-intelligent-with-custom-paths-238168","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":294,"executes":137,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/68079ef575fd65a56fea69cd0578598d0f743809e704099bd416a40fdf171c3d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/68079ef575fd65a56fea69cd0578598d0f743809e704099bd416a40fdf171c3d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-ea1d7223d35dd6e4afd7a7b7ecc720b8-3b73c66e96d6.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.363Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.363Z","lastBump":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.363Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ThetrulyAnonymous/ScriptsCollection/refs/heads/main/PathCreator.lua\"))()","features":"Tired of the game's crappy unit movement system? Why not make them more intelligent using this!\n\n[ HOW TO USE ]\nCreate a path by placing nodes which the units will follow. The order of placement will be the order in which units follow first (Just look at labels above)\n\n[ FEATURES ]\n-> Can create up to four paths (Units will go to the nearest first node)\n-> Delete the current path selected (Do note that units following that path will just stop)\n-> Move all Units (Make all units follow the nearest path)\n-> Auto March (All units that are spawned will follow the nearest path)\n-> Destroy all paths (Do note that units following the paths will just stop)\n-> The spreading of the units (How much you want to spread your units out, smaller number means they are closer together)\n-> Auto-shoot where they will destroy anything blocking their way","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","username":"Theultimateuser","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-21T02:30:44.099Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a36b111c775c9d2ea014ef9","editBy":{"_id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b","username":"Theultimateuser","status":"offline","id":"69d3c376e52e8dc73f4ccc9b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-06-20T15:26:09.367Z"}],"comments":[]}